    {
      "id": "support-form",
      "title": "Design a validated support request form",
      "requirements": "Build a support form with labelled Full name, Email, and Contact reason (Support, Invoice). Send request validates a nonempty name of at least two characters and a valid email. Invalid submission shows an accessible alert explaining the email problem and never confirms success. Valid submission announces Request received for <name> with a status region, preserves entered values, and works by keyboard without navigation/reload. Include inline help and clear focus states.",
