    {
      "id": "confirmation-dialog",
      "title": "Design an accessible project confirmation dialog",
      "requirements": "Build a project settings screen with Delete project opening a modal confirmation titled Delete Atlas project?. Use dialog semantics with an accessible name and aria-modal=true. Cancel is initially focused; focus stays within Cancel and Confirm delete, including Shift+Tab wrap. Escape or Cancel closes and restores focus to Delete project. Confirm delete closes the dialog and announces Project deleted in a status region. Do not actually delete external data.",
      "good_solution": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Design an accessible project confirmation dialog</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f0f4fa;color:#14213d;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(20px,5vw,64px)}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);line-height:1.1}h2{font-size:22px}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #79879b;border-radius:8px}button{background:#173d81;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d65e00;outline-offset:3px}label{display:block;font-weight:650;margin-top:16px}input,textarea,select{background:white;color:#14213d}header,.toolbar{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.card,form,section{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #14213d08}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:10px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ee}output,[role=status]{display:block;margin-top:18px;color:#064d37;font-weight:650}small{color:#4c5c74}[hidden]{display:none!important}a{color:#174e9b}nav{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}dialog{max-width:min(90vw,440px);border:0;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 20px 100px #0005}dialog::backdrop{background:#14213d88}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:22px}[role=tablist]{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}[role=tab][aria-selected=true]{background:#0c563e}.error{color:#aa1818}body[data-theme=dark]{background:#111b2c;color:#eef5ff}body[data-theme=dark] section{background:#203049;color:#eef5ff;border-color:#51647f}@media(max-width:639px){.nav-toggle{display:block}#site-links{width:100%;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:20px}td,th{font-size:13px}.card,form,section{padding:16px}}@media(min-width:640px){.nav-toggle{display:none}#site-links{display:flex!important}}</style></head><body><main><small>ATLAS / PROJECT SETTINGS</small><h1>Atlas project</h1><section><h2>Danger zone</h2><p>Deleting this demo project cannot be undone.</p><button id=\"open\">Delete project</button><p role=\"status\" id=\"status\"></p></section><dialog aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\"><h2 id=\"dialog-title\">Delete Atlas project?</h2><p>This action affects this local demonstration only.</p><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"cancel\" autofocus>Cancel</button><button id=\"confirm\">Confirm delete</button></div></dialog></main><script>const d=document.querySelector('dialog'),open=document.querySelector('#open'),cancel=document.querySelector('#cancel'),confirm=document.querySelector('#confirm');function close(){d.close();open.focus();}open.onclick=()=>{d.showModal();cancel.focus();};cancel.onclick=close;confirm.onclick=()=>{close();document.querySelector('#status').textContent='Project deleted';};d.addEventListener('cancel',e=>{e.preventDefault();close();});d.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key!=='Tab')return;if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===cancel){e.preventDefault();confirm.focus()}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===confirm){e.preventDefault();cancel.focus()}});</script></body></html>",
