    {
      "id": "responsive-navigation",
      "title": "Design responsive product navigation",
      "requirements": "Build Atlas product navigation with Overview, Features, Pricing links in a labelled Primary navigation landmark. At desktop 1280px links are visible. At mobile 390px hide links until Menu is activated; Menu reports aria-expanded, controls the links, supports Escape to close and restores focus. Links remain keyboard reachable when expanded. Activating Pricing shows a Pricing heading without an external navigation. Avoid horizontal overflow in both layouts.",
