      "id": "persistent-theme",
      "title": "Design persistent light and dark preferences",
      "requirements": "Build an appearance preferences page with a clear Light mode/Dark mode status, and an accessible button named Switch to dark mode or Switch to light mode for its next action. Default to Light mode. Toggling visibly changes body foreground and background to contrasting light/dark palettes and stores the choice locally so reload retains it. Keep controls usable at 390px. Do not use external assets or tracking.",
